{"name": "Blue Dynasty:Town Defense", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/1ce0bc6623db1180fc2fae61df3d8f22.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to become the savior of the great Blue dynasty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blue Dynasty is a \"Rogue Lite\" game that combines \"Tower Defense\" and \"Hack and Slash\" genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/035bce2df4333ec0138abbcd97cf7e6d.webp?t=1787298893\" height=\"504\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/035bce2df4333ec0138abbcd97cf7e6d.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"76\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/66e3a2945d9a2917ec44783a706d2e7c.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"332\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find new equipment, upgrade it, and dominate the dynasty map. The king will surely reward you for your efforts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/c8d27ac9a9d3ebcf55f8a937c78b32c7.webp?t=1787298893\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/c8d27ac9a9d3ebcf55f8a937c78b32c7.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"76\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/483d1e4713b66771328d54b91a1f5d53.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"332\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/ee348ebb024b782247ed78682e12f6d6.poster.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/ee348ebb024b782247ed78682e12f6d6.webm?t=1787298893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/ee348ebb024b782247ed78682e12f6d6.mp4?t=1787298893\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>While conquering the map, don't forget to clear the dungeons. Dungeons are as bountiful as they are dangerous; if you believe you can succeed, don't hesitate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/dabd451b6d077b742263b93c828c8c00.avif?t=1787298893\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/dabd451b6d077b742263b93c828c8c00.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"76\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/77ddf0dcbcf530b3ee17f1bd67271deb.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"332\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/51af19b2a24d3a0bb3a172f97aaa8976.webp?t=1787298893\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/51af19b2a24d3a0bb3a172f97aaa8976.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Remember, to clear the entire map, you must complete all 3 levels of each region.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/247f5cb825f3f71d3bdea80f0c75cdf2.avif?t=1787298893\" height=\"516\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/247f5cb825f3f71d3bdea80f0c75cdf2.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1600\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"76\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/4b319b7eff944822b419fdd0b5aad587.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"332\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every weapon type you use has its unique skills. As long as you time your moves correctly, every weapon is powerful.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/7a0cfa9fe4b5367f765c087489ced237.poster.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/7a0cfa9fe4b5367f765c087489ced237.webm?t=1787298893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/7a0cfa9fe4b5367f765c087489ced237.mp4?t=1787298893\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't forget to use your \"Dash\" skill to vary your movement and evade enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8562e510209dec8c8e73e1a265bb7996.poster.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8562e510209dec8c8e73e1a265bb7996.webm?t=1787298893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8562e510209dec8c8e73e1a265bb7996.mp4?t=1787298893\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your character will level up as you fight. When you level up, you can gain permanent abilities that will support you in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/4f1268a5d8e44fe1ab6ae9ef6cb13ac9.webp?t=1787298893\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/4f1268a5d8e44fe1ab6ae9ef6cb13ac9.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PASSIVE SKILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before entering battle, you can improve your passive abilities with the experience points you have earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras_big/08ca620980265b1b71f820bab83b648c.webp?t=1787298893\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/08ca620980265b1b71f820bab83b648c.avif?t=1787298893\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Blue Dynasty is a Medieval ARPG/Strategy game that blends TD and Hack and Slash genres with Rogue Lite mechanics. Dominate the map by strengthening your equipment, but remember there is no shield stronger than the city walls. If you are looking for challenging discoveries, the dungeons await you.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/e1149130fcb537d971b782a313bc72424aea6527/header.jpg?t=1787298893", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "Roguelite", "Action RPG", "Strategy", "Cute", "Hack and Slash"], "developers": "Kuntay Koca", "publishers": "Kuntay Koca", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3887660", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "3 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/tCX1zCy5L5w", "first_seen": 1777759200.0, "review_rank": 705}